      "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:02:34.767Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In most ERP systems, people only realize the value of backups after a crash.</p>\n<p>Last week, one business owner called me in panic — server down, data not opening, and no recent backup.</p>\n<p>That’s exactly why we built a fully automated Daily Cloud Backup System that quietly works in the background:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=14\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Every night, full ERP data backed up</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=14\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Auto-organizes by date</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=14\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> No manual work</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=14\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Old backups auto-removed</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/check_mark.png?v=14\" title=\":check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Data safe even if server fails</p>\n<p>A simple system…</p>\n<p>But for a business, it means peace of mind.</p>\n<p>If your ERP runs on a VPS, daily cloud backup is no more optional — it’s protection for your entire business.</p>",
